#: ../../source/docs/modules/systemtime.rst:3 e17968b9b7d94f4facc3a5297183880e
msgid "Time Sync"
msgstr "时间同步"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/systemtime.rst:9 8d1e208bd7124bc29ae5c35d8a66c1b0
msgid ""
"This module syncs the connected autopilot with the system (GCS) time. This "
"is useful if the autopilot does not have a GPS module."
msgstr "此模块将已连接的飞控与系统（GCS）时间进行同步。若飞控没有GPS模块，此功能尤为有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/systemtime.rst:12
#: 3e3ab1860c554618b3d8cb0111333f77
msgid ""
"It does this by sending ``SYSTEM_TIME`` MAVLink packets to the autopilot."
msgstr "同步方式是向飞控发送 ``SYSTEM_TIME`` MAVLink 数据包。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/systemtime.rst:14
#: c443f5c232aa4eb38078360036a7ba69
msgid ""
"The time sync will start when the module is loaded and continue until the "
"module is unloaded."
msgstr "时间同步将在模块加载时开始，并持续至模块卸载为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/systemtime.rst:16
#: 79ce99901a01477698016e5b962253c0
msgid ""
"The module has the following settings, which via be set via ``system_time "
"set``."
msgstr "该模块具有以下设置，可通过 ``system_time set`` 进行配置。"

