#: ../../source/docs/modules/systemtime.rst:26
#: 2ed835828be841adafca6ac43f2f5cb5
msgid ""
"Note: you will need to set bit 1 (MAVLINK_SYSTEM_TIME) in the "
":ref:`BRD_RTC_TYPES <BRD_RTC_TYPES>` bitmask on the autopilot to enable "
"updates from ``SYSTEM_TIME`` messages."
msgstr ""
"注意：需要在飞控的 :ref:`BRD_RTC_TYPES <BRD_RTC_TYPES>` "
"位掩码中设置第1位（MAVLINK_SYSTEM_TIME），以启用来自 ``SYSTEM_TIME`` 消息的时间更新。"
